This manual documents how XEmacs is packaged for macOS using CMake: the
@file{.app} bundle structure, the drag-and-drop @file{.dmg} produced by
@command{cpack -G DragNDrop}, the FHS tarball, and the rationale behind each
non-obvious design choice.  It is intended for maintainers building
distributions and for users who want to understand what the package they
installed actually contains.
